<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  DRAFT (2.4.n Pattern B) — Loxone → Earnie plant telemetry push.
  Replace EARNIE_HOST. Paths are placeholders until Earnie exposes ingest.
  Cmd Titles = frozen Merker names (share/loxone/greenfield_device_map.json).
  Netz/PV/Batterie_Leistung may also come from EFM Zähler — keep VO cmds; prefer EFM Bezeichnung in Earnie bindings when present.
  Earnie_Aussentemperatur is house-wide (shared with WP/Pool thermal).
  Earnie_Abwesend is house-wide absent / holiday mode (0/1).
  2.7.j optional ESS config ceilings: SOC-Min/Max + Max Lade-/Entladeleistung (get_ess_*).
  Value placeholder in a Virtual Output command is <v> (verified 2026-10-07 with a capture: the Virtual-Input style \v is sent as the
  control character 0x0B). <v> arrives with a point and 3 decimals (e.g. 6.333). In the XML attribute it is written &lt;v&gt;.
  Pilot (branch spike/vo-push-pilot): target is the daemon port 8541 (not the Streamlit port 8501); append ?t=TOKEN to the command
  (EARNIE_PILOT_PUSH_TOKEN). Repeat (e.g. 30 s) is set per command in Config.
-->
